    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Use the carrier’s tracking portal to monitor car delivery status in real time. Request photos of each packing stage and retain receipts for all materials. This documentation creates a paper trail that protects you from scams and validates the professionalism of the car carrier service you selected.</p>
