  <li><strong>Transparent communication:</strong> You will have constant updates about the vehicle's location, making communication between you and the transport company more transparent.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Speed Governors</h3>
<p>Another essential feature to consider is the presence of speed governors in the transport vehicles. Speed governors limit the maximum speed of the trucks, ensuring they don't exceed safe and reasonable driving conditions.</p>

<ul>
